SUMMARY:Animal Justice League Pet Adoptions
DTSTAMP:20260815T032442Z
DTSTART:20260815T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come have a beer and find a best friend. Join our friends at An
	imal Justice League as they set up at the brewery with the hopes of findin
	g you a new best friend. Come meet\, foster\, or just keep a puppy company
	. Donations are welcome to ensuring that we get Houston cats and dogs the 
	care they need.\n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/animal-justice-leag
	ue-pet-adoptions/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/animal-justice-league-pet-adoptions
	/
LOCATION:Tap Room\, 941 W 18TH ST.\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:eureka-heights-brew-co
CATEGORIES:Eureka Heights Brewery
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
